Per-rule pressure weight and trip overrides.
.TP
.I /usr/local/bfd/pressure-country.conf
Country pressure multiplier table (active when entries are uncommented).
.TP
.I /usr/local/bfd/ipcountry.dat
IP-to-country lookup database.
.TP
.I /usr/local/bfd/tlog
Track log \(em byte-offset log reader CLI wrapper.
.TP
.I /usr/local/bfd/update-ipcountry.sh
Script to download and update the IP-to-country database.
.TP
.I /usr/local/bfd/alert.bfd
Email alert template.
.TP
