Service rule files (42 rules).
.TP
.I /usr/local/bfd/tmp/events.dat
Pressure-scored failure event state (timestamp, IP, service, weight).
.TP
.I /usr/local/bfd/tmp/bans.active
Currently active bans.
.TP
.I /usr/local/bfd/tmp/bans.history
Historical ban/unban records.
.TP
